codex
The runtime IAM role can write to the production control table through a wildcard permission. I also found that emergency deployments create their review record only after rollout succeeds, so a failed rollout can leave an applied change without that record. Git tracking is unclear because this snapshot has no `.git` metadata.
apply patch
